        "original_id": "be7d3cb9-bb3d-54e6-9df5-bcdba95ce71a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ray Wilson, Leo, Ravi\n- Organizations: Genesis, Jellyfish Entertainment\n- Groups: Stiltskin, VIXX, VIXX LR\n- Roles: vocalist, singer, songwriter, musical theatre actor, rapper\n\nFacts:\n- Ray Wilson was born on 8 September 1968 and is a Scottish musician.\n- Ray Wilson is best known as the vocalist in the post-grunge band Stiltskin.\n- Ray Wilson was a member of Genesis from 1996 to 1998.\n- Leo, born Jung Taek-woon on 10 November 1990, is a South Korean singer, songwriter, and musical theatre actor.\n- Leo is signed under Jellyfish Entertainment.\n- VIXX LR was established in August 2015.\n- VIXX LR consists of VIXX's main vocalist Leo and main rapper Ravi.",
